    <string name="about_title">About Us</string>
    <string name="about_desc">The name MLMVPN is derived from its advanced core architecture: the Multi-Layer Multiplexer. We have pushed the boundaries of traditional networking by designing an ultra-intelligent, multi-layered platform instead of relying on a single connection. By simultaneously orchestrating several powerful anti-censorship engines, this application dynamically routes your traffic through the fastest and most secure paths available. Our mission is to provide a highly stable and ultra-fast network that shatters internet restrictions across multiple layers, delivering an unparalleled and truly free web experience.</string>
